# Counts are whole numbers or Bools, never Floats.
== SOURCE
1.5 2 r_eplicate 1 2
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected Bool or Int, found Float
 --> -e:1:1
  |
1 | 1.5 2 r_eplicate 1 2
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  | ----- this is a Float
  = note: `r_eplicate` has type Truthy a => a -> b -> b
  = help: a Float is not a condition or a count: `f_loor x` makes an Int of it, a comparison (`x > 0`) a Bool
